 "insight": [
  "The trend of export concentration by product chapters in Luxembourg from 2005 to 2025 shows mixed changes across different products.",
  "Exports of Plastics and articles thereof increased by 117.9 %, from 723.1 million euros in 2005 to 1.58 billion euros in 2025, peaking at 1.78 billion euros in 2022.",
  "Rubber and articles thereof exports also rose by 118.8 %, from 389.2 million euros in 2005 to 851.8 million euros in 2025, with a peak of 857.7 million euros in 2023.",
  "In contrast, Iron and steel exports declined by 35.0 %, from 1.72 billion euros in 2005 to 1.12 billion euros in 2025, after peaking at 2.67 billion euros in 2008.",
  "These values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, and 2.6 % of the data is confidential and shown separately, which may affect detailed analysis."
 ],
